Subject: [PATCH] tests: let format_exit nested call wait for the outer call

The outer process ran its gen_event call as soon as it was spawned,
so when the test process was descheduled it died before
:gen_server.call monitored it and the reason was :noproc.
---
--- a/lib/elixir/test/elixir/exception_test.exs
+++ b/lib/elixir/test/elixir/exception_test.exs
@@ -420,7 +420,7 @@
       outer_pid =
         spawn_link(fn ->
           Process.flag(:trap_exit, true)
-          :gen_event.call(spawn_link(exit_fun), :handler, :hello)
+          receive do: (_ -> :gen_event.call(spawn_link(exit_fun), :handler, :hello))
         end)
 
       reason =
